{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39619","headline":"寄郑县李侍御 · 黄滔","name":"寄郑县李侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古县新烟火，东西入客诗。\n静长如假日，贫更甚闲时。\n僧借松萝住，人将雨雪期。\n三年一官罢，岳石看成碑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}